3. Firestore data model as TypeScript types, with an audit trail on every write.
4. Seed script: 2 villages, 4 health workers, 3 mothers (all synthetic).
5. EN / हिं / मरा from day one; every UI string lives in `src/i18n/locales`.

**Step 2 — journey card**

6. Mother list per worker village: name, village, next dated milestone, plus
   **Register new mother** (name, village, language, expected delivery month).
7. Jo [… 3,752 characters omitted]     # react-i18next setup
