`updatedBy/updatedByRole/updatedAt`. All writes go through `createDoc` /
`updateDoc` in `src/services/audit.ts`, which stamp the document **and** append
an entry to `auditLog`. There is no delete path for milestones or visits: a
correction keeps the earlier version in `visit.revisions`.

